{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_9cff3bd119624badacf9a7467aca74be","excerpt":"- **详细审查** (端点: `/github_webhook`, `/gitlab_webhook`): - AI 尝试对每个文件的变更进行细致分析，目标是生成针对具体代码行（如果 AI 能定位）的、结构化的审查意见。 - 每个问题会作为一条独立的评论发布到 PR/MR 的对应代码行（如果可能）或作为整体评论的一部分。 - 此模式下，AI 模型被指示输出 JSON 格式的分析结果，系统随后将这些结果解析并转换为 PR/MR","id":"slc_7c6fb8c359723dd8299828b7b2855a5d52cabbb2394546ed38725bf532b0f572","locator":{"heading":"审查模式选择","kind":"lines","line_end":112,"line_start":105,"ordinal":11},"publication_allowed":true,"quotation_allowed":true,"record_type":"slice","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_id":"src_b2718afb11f55f5ebf6a124f1e05e591","source_version_id":"ver_897fe2f9f02720bd4de35ef51a44a4bdaf233ebefccaf25127b9f2713083c4e5","text_digest":"sha256:1990030da8aadd8d9cc7de3f2a5785a0d098542ed224485d425c902e08ed3d65","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:28:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_9cff3bd119624badacf9a7467aca74be"}
